{"task_id": "HumanEval/57", "solution": "def monotonic(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return True is list elements are monotonically increasing or decreasing.\"\"\"\n    if len(l) < 2:\n        return True\n\n    increasing = True\n    decreasing = True\n\n    for i in range(1, len(l)):\n        if l[i] > l[i-1]:\n            decreasing = False\n        elif l[i] < l[i-1]:\n            increasing = False\n        \n        # If both flags are false, we can short-circuit\n        if not increasing and not decreasing:\n            return False\n            \n    return increasing or decreasing"}
